QUERY NAME: ltdTestTime
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW TimeCostCalcs.Project, TimeCostCalcs.WorkGroup, Sum(TimeCostCalcs.Time) AS SumOfTime
FROM TestOrProduct INNER JOIN TimeCostCalcs ON TestOrProduct.ItemCode = TimeCostCalcs.JobCode
WHERE ((TimeCostCalcs.Month<=[forms]![frmLTD-ReportsMenu]![periodpick]))
GROUP BY TimeCostCalcs.Project, TimeCostCalcs.WorkGroup;

